# Block letters: Broken Trace on CLK_N between U5 pin 6 (3Y) and U16 pin 2 (CLK); the CLK input floats
# high and the shift register never shifts: each character shows its leftmost dot (F5) six dots wide.
machine message
title "Block letters"
brief "The letters have melted into solid bars and blocks; the poem can no longer be read."
fault crack U5.3Y U16.CLK 50%
